<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="6252402d-647e-44fc-a7bc-db3d2ad1f5e0" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Millau Viaduct Wonder</Name>
    <Teaser>Spanning more than two and a half kilometres across the Valley of the River Tarn, the Millau Viaduct is an engineering marvel.</Teaser>
    <Description>Spanning more than two and a half kilometres across the Valley of the River Tarn, the Millau Viaduct is an engineering marvel. It is the tallest bridge in the world, with a height of over three hundred metres from the top of the tower to the base, which also makes it the tallest man-made structure in France. Often the bridge is surrounded by clouds which gather in the valley. Ingame, the Millau Viaduct provides +1  Movement point to all land military units, and becomes available with Ecology.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Ambrox62</SpecialThanks>
